expressions.Words to watch: lion's share, tip of the iceberg, white elephant, 
gild the lily, take the plunge, ace up the sleeve, bird in the hand, twist of 
fate, at the end of the day.\n19. Relative time references: Prefer specific 
statements to general ones.Words to watch: recently, lately, currently, today, 
