ing-discovered-in-pylos\n\n[3] (PDF) SOME OBSERVATIONS ON THE ICONOGRAPHY OF 
THE ‘RING OF NESTOR’ 
https://www.academia.edu/83658257/SOME_OBSERVATIONS_ON_THE_ICONOGRAPHY_OF_THE_R
ING_OF_NESTOR_\n\n[4] (PDF) (2020) A. G. Vlachopoulos, “The Ring of Nestor and 
the quest for authenticity”, in F. Blakolmer (ed.) Current Approaches and New 
Perspectives in Aegean Iconography, Aegis 18 (2020), pp. 223-252. 
https://www.academia.edu/43416584/_2020_A.G._Vlachopoulos_The_Ring_of_Nestor_an
